# AstraOS package archives (chroot stage).
#
# Format: "<deb-line> <pin-priority or empty>"
#
# Every entry is an authenticated Debian archive over HTTPS or the official
# deb.debian.org mirror. AstraOS does not add third-party repositories, PPAs, or
# unsigned sources (plan §2.3, §13.3).
#
# debian-archive-keyring is part of the base system, so APT signature verification
# remains enabled. The build explicitly passes
# APT::Get::AllowUnauthenticated=false (see auto/config).

deb http://deb.debian.org/debian trixie main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
deb http://deb.debian.org/debian trixie-updates main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
deb http://security.debian.org/debian-security trixie-security main contrib non-free non-free-firmware

# NOTE: no backports. AstraOS 0.1.0 Alpha ships only packages from the pinned stable
# release plus its security and update suites, so a released image cannot silently
# pick up a newer ABI from an unrelated suite (plan §5).
